# built on 2026-09-25 and then discarded from the working repo at the user's
# request (kept only as a future reference, see gw2pvo_sems_migration.md).
#
# Provenance: ported from github.com/aroundmyroom/gw2pvo (fork, Aug 2026),
# which itself credits github.com/timvanderHorst/goodwe-semsplus for the
# reverse-engineered SEMS+ REST protocol. Two bugs in the fork's version were
# found and fixed here (see comments inline: dynamic regional gateway, lazy
# URL evaluation) plus a grid-voltage extraction bug and added per-MPPT power
# extraction.
#
# Verified end-to-end on 2026-09-25 against the real SEMS+ API with real
# credentials (login, current readings, multi-MPPT power, grid voltage,
# lat/long) — see gw2pvo_sems_migration.md for the confirmed endpoint list
# and sample responses. getDayReadings()/--date is NOT implemented (no known
# SEMS+ endpoint for historical per-day breakdown was found).
#
# To resume this work: copy this file's body (below the delimiter) back to
# gw2pvo/gw2pvo/sems_plus_api.py, re-add the `--gw-api sems|semsplus` flag and
# get_gw_api() dispatcher to gw2pvo/gw2pvo/__main__.py (see the migration doc
# for the exact diff description), and re-run the test scripts described in
# the migration doc to confirm nothing has changed API-side since.
